WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:10.038
My friends loved the treasure hunt.

2
00:00:10.039 --> 00:00:14.648
Bada was screaming with joy when he found a treasure.

3
00:00:14.649 --> 00:00:19.785
Why don't you try it on your birthday?

4
00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:23.223
Friend 1: Hana, I had a good time.

5
00:00:23.224 --> 00:00:27.007
Friend 2: Yeah! The treasure hunt was great.

6
00:00:27.008 --> 00:00:33.288
Hana: I am glad you guys liked it.

7
00:00:33.289 --> 00:00:36.094
Everyone: Thank you, Mrs. Kang!

8
00:00:36.095 --> 00:00:38.528
Mom: Thank you, everyone, for coming.

9
00:00:38.529 --> 00:00:41.045
Everyone: Bye, Hana.

10
00:00:41.046 --> 00:00:45.829
Hana: Bye! See you on Monday.

11
00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:54.134
Hana: Whew, the party was fun and the food was great. Thanks, Mom.

12
00:00:54.135 --> 00:00:58.905
Mom: You are very welcome.

13
00:00:58.906 --> 00:01:01.810
Bada: Hana, look what I found!

14
00:01:01.811 --> 00:01:03.780
Hana: Good for you, Bada.

15
00:01:03.781 --> 00:01:05.396
You can keep it.

16
00:01:05.397 --> 00:01:10.517
Bada: All right! Hana, can we do the treasure hunt again?

17
00:01:10.518 --> 00:01:15.250
Hana: If you behave and do what I say.

18
00:01:15.251 --> 00:01:17.288
Bada: I can do that.

19
00:01:17.289 --> 00:01:20.253
Hana: Then, we will do it again tomorrow.

20
00:01:20.254 --> 00:01:24.037
Hana: For now, you must help Mom clear the table.

21
00:01:24.038 --> 00:01:27.170
Bada: Yes, ma'am!

22
00:01:27.171 --> 00:01:30.775
Bada behaved and did what I told him.

23
00:01:30.776 --> 00:01:34.793
The next day, we did the treasure hunt again.

24
00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:38.171
It was really fun!
